        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b024454-35a1-4414-bf67-f2710891e441).Image",
        "Description": "&quot;Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client has requested the removal of four individuals who together control the Black Veil Syndicate—an organization responsible for corruption, political assassinations, weapons trafficking, and financial crimes on a global scale.\r\rEach target is indispensable to the syndicate&apos;s operation. Individually, they are dangerous. Together, they are untouchable. Make the BVS collapse from inside.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
